      302.47,
      432.56,
      541.73,
      475.41
    ],
    "text": "01. Lot No. 01 Name of the Land: Meegahakumbura; Description of the land : Paddy field; Claimant: Kuruppu Mudiyanselage Rathnakanthi Kuruppu; Extent: 0.2241 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.47,
      474.95,
      542.51,
      528.33
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid Land/servitude are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing before me at the Divisional Secretariat, Pannala on the 22nd January 2025 at 10.30 a.m.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      302.47,
      527.87,
      541.73,
      602.49
    ],
    "text": "And further, you are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 15th of January 2025, the nature of their interests in the land/servitude, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      9.960000038146973
    ]
